WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.389
Can you believe it’s been 10 years
since How Not to Die was published?

00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:06.160
Well, I’m thrilled to announce

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:11.040
that an updated 10th anniversary
edition of the classic

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.800
is being published this December.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.120
15 chapters and each of the
leading 15 causes of death,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.560
talking about the role diet may play

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.640
in preventing, arresting, or
reversing each of our top 15 killers,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.040
along with practical tools
like my traffic light system

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.340
and the Daily Dozen
to help you eat healthier.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.508
And the revised edition
has all the juicy stuff

00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:32.640
that's been published
in the last decade

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.761
like Dr. Ornish's
Alzheimer's study

00:00:34.761 --> 00:00:37.200
or things we'd like to
forget, like COVID-19,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.374
and the latest on cannabis,
and on down the list.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.800
To find out how to
preorder your copy today,

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.763
visit nutritionfacts.org/books.

